                                "sense_id": "940b9a4e-7649-3f31-8792-05245346f901",
                                "text": "In 1923, the Prince de Broglie showed mathematically that particles, in turn, should exhibit wavelike properties, a prediction that led to the development of the field of wave mechanics."
                            }
